  "worked_solution": "In the model, we have $\\frac{1}{7}$ multiplied by $2.$ This means that we need to make $2$ copies of the given fraction model.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129500/assets/82b10634617ced674679357c09fc134439156cf17c3ce3a4b354070b9f1efc77.png)\n\n \n\nSo, the missing picture is:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129500/assets/32eccf715a97aa92b88684c49a9b24f8d6cd90307d18d08a5bddf57ab37c3d89.png)",
